  "title": {
   "en": "Uragirareta no de, Ouhitsuki Jijo ni Job Change!"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "裏切られたので、王妃付き侍女にジョブチェンジ！"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Uragirareta node, Ouhitsuki Jijo ni Job Change!"
   },
   {
    "en": "I was Betrayed, so I Changed My Job to the Queen's Maid of Honor!"
   },
   {
    "en": "From Ordinary Maid to Chief Lady-in-Waiting to the Queen"
   },
   {
    "ko": "배신당해서 왕비님의 전속 시녀로 직업 체인지!"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Marsha, the daughter of a nobleman, gave up on love after discovering her fiancé’s betrayal—determined to show him what true feminine pride looks like. Years later, Marsha has become the queen’s chief lady-in-waiting at the royal court, excelling at her duties amid mysterious events, conspiracies, and sometimes even unexpected love stories.\n\nDespite her success, her confidence in matters of love is nearly nonexistent. Will she be able to find her path to happiness in a palace world full of surprises?",
   "ja": "浮気しながら、婚約継続！？失意の子爵令嬢マーシャは決意する！女の意地、見せてあげるよ。ねぇ、ラウル？それから幾年月、グラン王国宮廷には王妃マイラ付きの筆頭侍女として腕を振るうマーシャの姿があった！周囲で巻き起こるは事件や陰謀、はたまたロマンス！？敏腕だけど恋路は自己肯定感ゼロな、王妃付き筆頭侍女マーシャの王宮ロマンス奔走記！"
  },
